5837dc1bece7\"], \"entity_scope\": \"event\", \"time_scope\": \"recent\", \"parent_versions\": {}, \"retract_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"User states 'I've also organized a festival highlighting Pacific Islander artists in a modern setting, showcasing their fusion works.' This is an event involving music/sound. The time scope 'recent' is inferred from the original question 'recently attended an event' and the message indices (165-167) are later in the conversation, but no explicit calendar time is given; however, the question itself establishes 'recent' as the required scope.\", \"variable\": \"recent_events\", \"revoked\": [], \"semantic_status\": \"model_judgment\"}], \"source_spans\": [{\"id\": \"s129\", \"source_id\": \"src_8ef0d564b162b87139ef6f5d\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:a778cffebd69d28ebcda63b5e6544932631898545b084b7906be70b3bd88e8c5\", \"start\": 1033, \"end\": 1302, \"text\": \"It was amazing to see the diverse array of talents displayed, each artist pouring their heart and soul into their performances. The vibrant colors of traditional attire, coupled with contemporary designs, created an atmosphere that was both exhilarating and nostalgic. \", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [165, 166], \"time_metadata\": {\"observed_start\": 165.0, \"observed_end\": 167.0, \"event_start\": null, \"event_end\": null, \"validity\": \"unknown\", \"time_source\": \"message_index\"}}, {\"id\": \"s130\", \"source_id\": \"src_656e02d94ae75837dc1bece7\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:a778cffebd69d28ebcda63b5e6544932631898545b084b7906be70b3bd88e8c5\", \"start\": 1302, \"end\": 1582, \"text\": \"Attendees shared laughter, stories, and experiences, bridging generational gaps and forging deeper connections within our community. Overall, the festival served as a beautiful reminder of our rich cultural heritage and the importance of preserving it through artistic expression.\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [165, 166], \"time_met